Cells with a comma, quote or newline are now wrapped in quotes with inner quotes doubled, per RFC 4180. I also prefix cells starting with `=`, `+`, `-` or `@` with a `'` so a customer named `=HYPERLINK(...)` can't run as a formula when someone opens the file in Excel. Tests for csv.ts and the export route are running in the background.

