```ts
await invoiceRemindersQueue.upsertJobScheduler('daily-invoice-reminders', { pattern: '0 13 * * *' }, { name: 'fan-out' });
// fan-out -> one 'org' job per org -> one 'invoice-reminder' email job per invoice due in 3 days
```

Runs daily at 13:00 UTC (9:00 Toronto). The email jobId includes invoice id and date, so a retry or double run never sends the same reminder twice.

